{ Wall St: Write about Cyclops }
[] Cyclops : Analyzes CPU simulation runs and plots out critical path latencies, stalls in Front End, Back End, Register File and ALU Utilization. Critical stalls are those that are preventing instructions from retiring and any upstream stalls contributing towards this. Useful for studying compiler instruction scheduling inefficiencies as well as regular code to understand what optimizations to chase.


